  setMessages(restored);
}).catch(()=>undefined);
```
But careful: restored assistant messages have `parts` text. Good. Notices absent.

However, resuming should perhaps not override if user already started typing? Boot runs once on mount; fine.

sendMessage: add `conversation_id: conversationId` to streamChat payload, and dependency.

handleEvent: add cases:
```ts
case "conversation": {
  const id = String(event.data.id ?? "");
  if (id) setConversationId(id);
  break;
}
case "memory": {
  const raw = event.data.observation as Observation | undefined;
